<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR is stable at 10.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR is stable at 10.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month was steady at 10.25 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) edged up to 9.77 percent from 9.76 percent.</p>
